const DIALOGUE = {"speakers":{"osric":{"name":"Father Osric"},"greta":{"name":"Greta the Smith"},"ysolde":{"name":"Mother Ysolde"},"tam":{"name":"Tam the Peddler"},"narrator":{"name":""},"warrior":{"name":""},"rogue":{"name":""},"sorcerer":{"name":""},"malric":{"name":"Malric the Flayer"},"bishop":{"name":"Aldwyn, the Buried Bishop"},"webmother":{"name":"The Mother of Webs"},"vaelzhor":{"name":"Vael'Zhor"}},"lines":{"osric_greet1":["osric","Peace be with you, child. What little of it remains."],"osric_greet2":["osric","The bells rang again last night. Did you hear them? No. Only the old ones hear them now."],"osric_greet3":["osric","You return. Good. The dead are patient, but I am not."],"osric_intro":["osric","So. Another one comes to Ravenhollow with a blade and a reckless heart.\n\nListen well. Beneath the hill lies the old abbey, and beneath the abbey, the Ashen Chapel. Forty years ago Bishop Aldwyn heard a voice singing beneath the chapel floor, and he dug until he found it. The earth swallowed the abbey that night. Monks, bells and all.\n\nNow the dead walk its halls. Brother Malric, the abbey's flayer, was the first to answer the voice. He waits on the third level of the abbey. End him, and perhaps the rest can be ended too."],"osric_q1active":["osric","Brother Malric still hungers on the third level of the abbey. Be careful. He charges like a bull when he smells fresh blood."],"osric_q1done":["osric","Malric is dead? Then the abbey's hold is weakening.\n\nBut there is worse below. Bishop Aldwyn himself did not die when the earth closed over him. He preaches still, down in the ossuary on the sixth level, and the dead rise from their niches to hear him. Silence him. Take this for your trouble."],"osric_q2active":["osric","The Buried Bishop preaches in the ossuary, on the sixth level. Beware his censer, and do not listen to his sermon for too long."],"osric_q2done":["osric","Aldwyn is silent at last. God keep his poor, mad soul.\n\nBut the miners who fled the deep caves speak of something else. A vast spider, the Mother of Webs, nesting on the ninth level. The caves were never dug by men, they say. Something wove them. Take this, and go."],"osric_q3active":["osric","The Mother of Webs breeds in the Hollow Deep, on the ninth level. Burn her nest."],"osric_q3done":["osric","Then only the singer remains.\n\nI know its name now, though it costs me to say it. Vael'Zhor. The Drowned Saint. The voice that Aldwyn followed into the dark. It waits in the Burning Abyss, on the twelfth level, beneath everything.\n\nThis is the last of what I can give you. May the light go with you."],"osric_q4active":["osric","Vael'Zhor waits on the twelfth level, in the Burning Abyss. All of Ravenhollow is holding its breath."],"osric_q4done":["osric","The bells have stopped. For the first time in forty years, the bells have stopped.\n\nYou have done what none of us could. Stay as long as you like. Though I suspect the dark will always call to someone like you."],"osric_identify":["osric","Let me see. Yes. These are their true natures."],"osric_nogold":["osric","I am afraid knowledge has a price, my child."],"osric_talk1":["osric","I was a novice when the abbey fell. I carried water to the masons who dug beneath the chapel. I still dream of the sound the floor made when it opened."],"osric_talk2":["osric","Do not trust every shrine you find below. Some were raised to God. Others were raised to something that only wears His colours."],"osric_talk3":["osric","Pray if you must. But keep your blade sharp. Down there, the one is no use without the other."],"greta_greet1":["greta","The forge is hot. Speak, or step aside."],"greta_greet2":["greta","Back in one piece. Mostly, I see."],"greta_greet3":["greta","Mind the sparks. And mind your manners."],"greta_talk1":["greta","Need steel? Everything I forge is made to kill what crawls up out of that hole."],"greta_talk2":["greta","My father cast the bells of the abbey. Now they ring by themselves at night. He'd have hated that. A bell should answer to the rope."],"greta_talk3":["greta","Bring me whatever you find down there. I'll pay you fair for it. Fairer than Tam, at least."],"greta_talk4":["greta","The dead wear old iron. Bad iron. If you take a sword off a skeleton, have me look at it before you trust your life to it."],"greta_talk5":["greta","My husband went down after the first tremors. I found his hammer on the abbey steps. Just the hammer."],"ysolde_greet1":["ysolde","Sit, child. Let me see those wounds."],"ysolde_greet2":["ysolde","There, there. The flesh remembers how to mend."],"ysolde_greet3":["ysolde","You smell of the grave. Come closer, and let me tend to you."],"ysolde_talk1":["ysolde","The herbs won't grow near the abbey any more. The soil there is wrong. It tastes of ash and pennies."],"ysolde_talk2":["ysolde","Drink, and go with what grace you have left."],"ysolde_talk3":["ysolde","If a wound turns black and cold, do not wait. Come to me, or cut it away yourself. The poison in the deep places does not forgive."],"ysolde_talk4":["ysolde","I have buried more of this village than I have birthed. Don't you add to the count."],"tam_greet1":["tam","Psst! Treasures from far lands! What's in the sack? Ah, that's the fun of it!"],"tam_greet2":["tam","My favourite customer! Well. My only customer who's still breathing."],"tam_greet3":["tam","Coin first, questions never. That's the Tam guarantee."],"tam_talk1":["tam","No refunds. No questions. No looking inside."],"tam_talk2":["tam","I've sold to kings and I've sold to corpses. The coin's the same colour."],"tam_talk3":["tam","Where do I find my wares? Here and there. Mostly there. Don't go there."],"tam_talk4":["tam","Old Osric thinks I'm a crook. He's right, of course, but it's rude to say so."],"lore1":["narrator","And the Bishop Aldwyn heard a voice beneath the floor of the chapel, sweet as a hymn, and he called for the masons."],"lore2":["narrator","Brother Malric has stopped eating. He says the hunger is not his own."],"lore3":["narrator","We sealed the lower crypts. May God forgive what we left inside."],"lore4":["narrator","The Bishop preaches to the bones now. And the bones, God help us, have begun to listen."],"lore5":["narrator","The deep caves were never dug by men. Something wove them."],"lore6":["narrator","Water rose through the nave and did not fall again. The Saint drowned, and did not die."],"lore7":["narrator","Vael'Zhor. Do not write the name. Do not say the name. Do not..."],"lore8":["narrator","Day nineteen. The candles burn down to nothing, and yet in the morning they are whole again. Someone is lighting them. It is not us."],"lore9":["narrator","I counted the skulls in the eastern niches three times. Each time there was one more."],"lore10":["narrator","Penance keeps the light alive. Carry it, pilgrim, and do not look back at what follows."],"victory":["narrator","The water recedes from the drowned nave. Somewhere far above, the bells of Ravenhollow fall silent. The valley is freed from the Drowned Saint. But the dark still stirs in the deep places, and it remembers your name."],"title":["narrator","Ravenhollow. Forty years since the abbey sank into the earth. Forty years of bells at midnight. Faith descends. And so must you."],"warrior_invfull":["warrior","No room. I'll have to leave something behind."],"warrior_nomana":["warrior","Not enough mana."],"warrior_cantuse":["warrior","I can't use that. Not yet."],"warrior_noportal":["warrior","I have no scrolls of Town Portal."],"warrior_levelup":["warrior","I grow stronger."],"warrior_lowhp":["warrior","I need healing."],"warrior_unique":["warrior","Now this. This is something rare."],"warrior_bosskill":["warrior","Rest now. And stay dead."],"rogue_invfull":["rogue","My pack is full."],"rogue_nomana":["rogue","I've no mana left."],"rogue_cantuse":["rogue","I'm not ready for that yet."],"rogue_noportal":["rogue","I'm out of Town Portal scrolls."],"rogue_levelup":["rogue","I feel sharper. Quicker."],"rogue_lowhp":["rogue","I'm bleeding badly."],"rogue_unique":["rogue","Oh, now that is beautiful."],"rogue_bosskill":["rogue","One less nightmare in the dark."],"sorcerer_invfull":["sorcerer","I cannot carry any more."],"sorcerer_nomana":["sorcerer","My mana is spent."],"sorcerer_cantuse":["sorcerer","That is beyond me. For now."],"sorcerer_noportal":["sorcerer","I have no means of returning to town."],"sorcerer_levelup":["sorcerer","The power grows within me."],"sorcerer_lowhp":["sorcerer","My life is slipping away."],"sorcerer_unique":["sorcerer","Fascinating. There is old power in this."],"sorcerer_bosskill":["sorcerer","Your song is over."],"malric_aggro":["malric","Fresh meat for the hungry brother! Come closer. Come closer!"],"malric_death":["malric","The hunger... is not... mine..."],"bishop_aggro":["bishop","Kneel, sinner. The sermon is not over. It will never be over."],"bishop_summon":["bishop","Rise, my faithful! Rise, and listen!"],"bishop_death":["bishop","Forgive me. I only wanted to hear it sing."],"webmother_aggro":["webmother","Little fly. Little warm fly. Stay. Stay forever in my web."],"webmother_death":["webmother","My children... will remember you..."],"vaelzhor_aggro":["vaelzhor","You have come so far down, only to drown with me. The water is patient. The water is eternal."],"vaelzhor_death":["vaelzhor","The bells... I hear... the bells..."],"warrior_invfull_2":["warrior","My pack is full."],"warrior_invfull_3":["warrior","I can carry no more."],"warrior_nomana_2":["warrior","The flame is spent."],"warrior_nomana_3":["warrior","My lantern needs time."],"warrior_cantuse_2":["warrior","That is beyond me. For now."],"warrior_noportal_2":["warrior","No way home. Not without a scroll."],"warrior_levelup_2":["warrior","The flame burns brighter."],"warrior_levelup_3":["warrior","Penance makes me stronger."],"warrior_lowhp_2":["warrior","I'm bleeding... badly."],"warrior_lowhp_3":["warrior","Not here. Not yet."],"warrior_unique_2":["warrior","A relic. From before the fall."],"warrior_bosskill_2":["warrior","It is done. Let it stay done."],"warrior_kill":["warrior","Back to the dark."],"warrior_kill_2":["warrior","Rest."],"warrior_kill_3":["warrior","One less."],"warrior_kill_4":["warrior","Forgive them."],"warrior_descend":["warrior","Deeper still."],"warrior_descend_2":["warrior","The air grows colder."],"warrior_descend_3":["warrior","Keep the lantern lit."],"warrior_descend_4":["warrior","Down. Always down."],"warrior_idle":["warrior","Standing still won't save anyone."],"warrior_idle_2":["warrior","The dead are patient. I should not be."],"warrior_idle_3":["warrior","My penance won't finish itself."],"warrior_idle_4":["warrior","Even the lantern grows restless."],"warrior_idle_5":["warrior","Too quiet. I don't trust it."],"warrior_idle_6":["warrior","Move, old bones. Move."]}};
